{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>Saying: I have caused you to see it, that I will give it to your seed.</b> So that you would go and say to Abraham, to Isaac, and to Jacob: The oath that the Holy One, blessed be He, swore to you — He has fulfilled it. And this is <b>saying</b> — for this reason I have shown it to you, but it is a decree from Me that there <b>you shall not cross</b>; for were it not so, I would have kept you alive until you see them planted and established in it, and you would go and tell them."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:49:57.244995370Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}